	\nNate Jackson\, one of the fastest-rising stars in stand-up comedy\, brin
	gs his electrifying Big Dog Tour to the intimate Blue Note Hawaii in Honol
	ulu. With over 4.5 million TikTok followers and 700 million global views\,
	 Jackson delivers sharp crowd work and fearless comedy that leaves audienc
