SUMMARY:Evening Forest Hike
DTSTAMP:20260706T122900Z
DTSTART:20260813T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:[hiking]\nWhether you’re looking to relax\, enjoy nature\, or m
	eet others in the community\, this hike offers the perfect midweek reset.\
