	rsive LED visuals\, confetti storms & laser light shows Epic Demon Hunters
	 moments with cinematic staging Instagram-worthy photo ops and roaming per
	formers It?s not just a concert ? it?s an interactive K-Pop adventure that
	 turns every guest into part of the show.\nDoors: 7PM Show: 8PM All Ages K
